{"id":"111292e5b427d35c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-first-order-language.md","title":"First-order language and signature","display":"df-first-order-language — First-order language and signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-first-order-language","aliases":["72-df-first-order-language"],"display":"df-first-order-language — First-order language and signature","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files","source_kind":"local-reconstruction","verification_status":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-first-order-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-first-order-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-language — First-order language and signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-reconstruction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论为 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,F,R\">\\(C,F,R\\)</span> 是集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,a_F,a_R\">\\(a,a_F,a_R\\)</span> 是集合编码的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,n\\in\\omega\">\\(i,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{&lt;\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^n\">\\(X^{&lt;\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^n\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^n\">\\(X^n\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的函数集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n}\">\\(\\langle x_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n}\\)</span> 为这种序列，结构元组及二元关系使用有序对编码。</li>\n<li>下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{var}\">\\(\\mathsf{var}\\)</span> 是固定语法标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 是对象变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 分别遍历满足下列谓词的四元语言和五元签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 遍历二者的并。谓词中的函数记号同时要求显示的定义域和值域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_i:=\\langle\\mathsf{var},i\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}_S:=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_i:=\\langle\\mathsf{var},i\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}_S:=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow C\\cap F=C\\cap R=F\\cap R=\\varnothing\\land(C\\cup F\\cup R)\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists C,F,R,a\\ [L=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)\\land a:R\\cup F\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FormulaSignature}_S(\\Sigma)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists C,F,R,a_F,a_R\\ [\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)\\land a_F:F\\to\\omega\\land a_R:R\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(U)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n\\langle C,F,a\\restriction F,R,a\\restriction R\\rangle,&amp;U=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(U),\\\\\nU,&amp;\\operatorname{FormulaSignature}_S(U).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow C\\cap F=C\\cap R=F\\cap R=\\varnothing\\land(C\\cup F\\cup R)\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists C,F,R,a\\ [L=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)\\land a:R\\cup F\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FormulaSignature}_S(\\Sigma)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists C,F,R,a_F,a_R\\ [\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)\\land a_F:F\\to\\omega\\land a_R:R\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(U)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n\\langle C,F,a\\restriction F,R,a\\restriction R\\rangle,&amp;U=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(U),\\\\\nU,&amp;\\operatorname{FormulaSignature}_S(U).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是对原压缩包所调用、但未提供正文的语言接口的本地重建，不声称是第58本书缺失文件的逐字副本。四元与五元结构长度不同，两个分支互斥；两类有效输入均得到唯一的五元签名。没有附加可数性、有效性或正元数假设；后续需要这些条件时须单独声明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"C,F,R","display":false},{"tex":"a,a_F,a_R","display":false},{"tex":"i,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X^{<\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^n","display":false},{"tex":"X^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x_i\\rangle_{i<n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{var}","display":false},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"v_i:=\\langle\\mathsf{var},i\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}_S:=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)&:\\Longleftrightarrow C\\cap F=C\\cap R=F\\cap R=\\varnothing\\land(C\\cup F\\cup R)\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists C,F,R,a\\ [L=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)\\land a:R\\cup F\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FormulaSignature}_S(\\Sigma)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists C,F,R,a_F,a_R\\ [\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Disj}_V(C,F,R)\\land a_F:F\\to\\omega\\land a_R:R\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(U)&:=\\begin{cases}\n\\langle C,F,a\\restriction F,R,a\\restriction R\\rangle,&U=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(U),\\\\\nU,&\\operatorname{FormulaSignature}_S(U).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2381,"backlinks":[{"id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"非逻辑符号采用互异且不属于 $\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 的固定符号标签。语言与基本语法取 [[72-df-first-order-language]]、[[72-df-first-order-formula]]；$\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L,\\operatorname{FV}_L$ 取 [[72-df-free-variable]]。对象公式位置的印刷等号 $=$ 表示 $\\doteq$；$\\neg,\\lor,\\forall$ 为基本语法，其他联结词是下式的宏，不是演算扩充语法的独立节点。"},{"id":"2c943d760d42086b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U$ 为 [[72-df-first-order-language]] 的有效语言或签名，$\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(U)=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$，$V:=\\mathrm{Var}_S$。$c\\in C,f\\in F,P\\in R,x\\in V$。"},{"id":"869d1b6ed24b3a9d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L=\\langle R,F,C,a\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-first-order-language]] 的 $\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)$；$\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S$ 取 [[72-df-first-order-language]] 的四元到五元转换。"}],"outgoing":[]}